Subject: [PATCH 2942/3799] soh: rename func_80B40E64 ->
 EnXc_NextAfterNocturneThrowNut

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the same guard from the Nocturne nut throw to action 77
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
index 4cfc8a879..2d4f8a72f 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
@@ -2058,7 +2058,8 @@ void EnXc_NextAfterNocturneReverseHalt(EnXc* this) {
     EnXc_CheckAndSetAction(this, SHEIK_ACTION_NOCTURNE_REVERSE_HALT, SHEIK_ACTION_NOCTURNE_THROW_NUT);
 }
 
-void func_80B40E64(EnXc* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B40E64: the same guard from the Nocturne nut throw to action 77
+void EnXc_NextAfterNocturneThrowNut(EnXc* this) {
     EnXc_CheckAndSetAction(this, SHEIK_ACTION_NOCTURNE_THROW_NUT, SHEIK_ACTION_77);
 }
 
@@ -2238,7 +2239,7 @@ void EnXc_ReverseHaltInNocturneCS(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
 
 void EnXc_ThrowNutInNocturneCS(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
     EnXc_ThrowNut(this, play);
-    func_80B40E64(this);
+    EnXc_NextAfterNocturneThrowNut(this);  // was func_80B40E64 [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
 void EnXc_DeleteInNocturneCS(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
